*> vybe-test: cobol/tables/test_table_2d_occurs
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_tables.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TABLE-2D.
   05 WS-ROW OCCURS 3 TIMES.
      10 WS-COL OCCURS 3 TIMES.
         15 WS-CELL PIC 9 VALUE 5.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY WS-CELL(2 3).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-CELL(2 DELIMITED SIZE 3) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "5"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [5] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

